{"title":"세자, 죽이기","thumbnail":"https://dn-img-page.kakao.com/download/resource?kid=TaxQk/dJMcaijvZVS/QRkI6x8FUpuN3hAyJV9J00&filename=th3","synopsis":"궁중 하녀 모제비는 동궁 침방의 나인, \n남모란을 모시며 평온한 나날을 보내고 있었다.\n그러던 어느 날, 남모란이 거처를 옮긴 뒤 행방이 묘연해진다.\n\n불안한 마음에 모제비는 몰래 동궁에 숨어들어\n모란의 행방을 묻고자 했으나,\n그곳에서 뜻밖의 비밀을 엿보게 된다.\n\n동궁에 감춰진 끔찍한 진실 앞에서 제비는 옴짝달싹 못한 채\n험악한 구중궁궐 속에서 살아남기 위해 발버둥친다.\n하지만 동궁의 비밀에 희생된 궁녀들을 끝내 외면할 수 없었다.\n제비의 눈에, 그들의 혼백이 보였기 때문이다.","topComments":[],"commentKeywords":[],"rankSeries":{"daily":[{"date":"2026-08-09","rank":86,"change":{"type":"down","amount":27}},{"date":"2026-08-10","rank":112,"change":{"type":"down","amount":26}},{"date":"2026-08-11","rank":140,"change":{"type":"down","amount":28}},{"date":"2026-08-12","rank":159,"change":{"type":"down","amount":19}},{"date":"2026-08-13","rank":151,"change":{"type":"up","amount":8}},{"date":"2026-08-14","rank":118,"change":{"type":"up","amount":33}},{"date":"2026-08-15","rank":66,"change":{"type":"up","amount":52}},{"date":"2026-08-16","rank":83,"change":{"type":"down","amount":17}},{"date":"2026-08-17","rank":121,"change":{"type":"down","amount":38}},{"date":"2026-08-18","rank":148,"change":{"type":"down","amount":27}},{"date":"2026-08-19","rank":162,"change":{"type":"down","amount":14}},{"date":"2026-08-21","rank":174,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-22","rank":62,"change":{"type":"up","amount":112}},{"date":"2026-08-23","rank":88,"change":{"type":"down","amount":26}},{"date":"2026-08-24","rank":119,"change":{"type":"down","amount":31}},{"date":"2026-08-25","rank":144,"change":{"type":"down","amount":25}},{"date":"2026-08-26","rank":158,"change":{"type":"down","amount":14}},{"date":"2026-08-27","rank":159,"change":null},{"date":"2026-08-28","rank":138,"change":{"type":"up","amount":21}},{"date":"2026-08-29","rank":59,"change":{"type":"up","amount":79}},{"date":"2026-08-30","rank":99,"change":{"type":"down","amount":40}},{"date":"2026-08-31","rank":125,"change":{"type":"down","amount":26}},{"date